This repository contains original work by Yudai Imai:
  - cloudrun-proxy/        (Go proxy for Cloud Run)
  - gce-t4-spot/           (provisioning scripts, systemd unit, test client)
  - cloudrun-l4/           (Dockerfile, build config, entrypoint, test scripts)

This repository also contains material derived from the following project:

  Kev
  https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev
  Copyright 2026 Jared Palmer
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

Derived material:
  - gce-t4-spot/server.py builds on kev.serve from the project above and
    changes it (Spot preemption handling, idle shutdown, /ready, direct GPU
    loading).
  - cloudrun-l4/patches/async-init.patch is a modification of kev/serve.py
    from the project above (background model loading and a /health endpoint).

The Kev source code itself is not included. The build scripts fetch it from
the upstream repository.

Cold-start techniques in cloudrun-l4/ (GCSFuse buffered-read, Direct VPC
egress, /dev/shm prefetch) follow the design of the Djev-run project.
